        "dedup_by": "order_id"
      },
      "description": "月度指標表須在排除 CANCELLED 訂單並以 order_id 去重後，各月有效訂單數與淨銷售額與原始資料重算一致。",
      "required": true,
      "authority": "client",
      "hidden": false,
      "unverified": false
